                <pb facs="0577" n="461" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg461"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1084.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 18, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am informed by Receivership that Dominicans under Julio Castillo are supporting
                    Haitian revolution. Have informed Dominican Government and am promised speedy
                    action to prevent this activity.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
